OL,5,G0200 Trucking Hell
OL,6,     FOn the busy A1, halfway between
OL,7,     FNewcastle and Durham, an
OL,8,     Farticulated lorry has fallen down
OL,9,     Fa 20-metre embankment. The Alpha
OL,10,     FRecovery crew must work out how to
OL,11,     Fretrieve the truck.
OL,12,G0300 Trucking Hell
OL,13,     FSean tackles a telehandler that's
OL,14,     Fflipped over in a very muddy
OL,15,     Fgarden. How will he and his team
OL,16,     Fsafely lift it out to get it back
OL,17,     Fto the depot? And a sunken car
OL,18,     Fgets into deep trouble.
